# Semgrep Ignore File
# Excludes build artifacts, minified files, tests, and tooling

# Build outputs and distributions
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/out/**
**/target/**
**/bin/**
**/obj/**
**/.output/**

# Minified and bundled files
**/*.min.js
**/*.min.css
**/*.bundle.js
**/*.chunk.js
**/bundle.*.js
**/vendor.js
**/vendors.js

# Node.js dependencies
**/node_modules/**
**/bower_components/**

# Test files and directories
**/__tests__/**
**/__mocks__/**
**/tests/**
**/test/**
**/*.test.js
**/*.test.ts
**/*.spec.js
**/*.spec.ts

# Build and development tooling
**/scripts/**
**/tools/**
**/config/**
**/webpack/**
**/rollup/**
**/vite/**
**/.storybook/**
**/eslint/**
**/prettier/**

# Generated and vendor code
**/generated/**
**/autogen/**
**/vendor/**
**/third_party/**
**/thirdparty/**
**/.next/**
**/.nuxt/**

# Documentation and examples
**/docs/**
**/examples/**
**/demo/**
**/samples/**

# Lock files and configs
package-lock.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
